/*:
 * @target MZ
 * @plugindesc Record video footage and capture screenshot of your game.
 * @author Sang Hendrix
 * @url https://sanghendrix.itch.io
 *
 * @help
 * Version 1.0.1
 * For support or bug report, please contact via Discord
 * Discord: https://discord.gg/YKPscqHV8b
 * Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/SangHendrix
 * ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * This RPG Maker MZ plugin lets you capture screenshots or record video footage
 * of your game. It’s designed with user experience in mind: fast, simple,
 * and convenient. With this plugin, you no longer need third‑party software
 * or complicated setups.
 * ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * ■ HOW TO USE
 * ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * After enabling the plugin, hover your mouse to the top of the screen
 * and you'll see the control panel drop down.
 * 
 * All results will be inside the "screenshots" folder in your game root.
 * 
 * SHORTCUTS:
 * Press -         → Take a screenshot
 * Press =         → Start video recording (fullscreen)
 * Press = again   → Stop recording and save video
 * 
 * ■ RECORDING METHODS
 * ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * MediaRecorder (Compatible):
 *   Works on all NW.js versions. Outputs .webm file.
 *   Might tank performance, not super recommended but it's still usable.
 * 
 * WebCodecs (NW.js 0.111+ only):
 *   Requires NW.js 0.111+ (Chromium 148). Outputs .mp4 file.
 *   Recommended as it's more friendly to the performance.
 *   Don't know how to update your Nw.js? Contact me via Discord.
 * 
 * Tutorial Videos: https://sanghendrix.itch.io/hendrix-screen-recorder-rpg-maker-mz-plugin
 * ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * ■ TERMS OF USE
 * ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * https://www.rpgmakeractioncombat.com/p/sang-hendrixs-rpg-maker-plugin-terms-of.html
 * ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * Libraries used:
 *   fix-webm-duration (MIT) - https://github.com/yusitnikov/fix-webm-duration
 *   mp4-muxer (MIT) - https://github.com/Vanilagy/mp4-muxer
 * ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * 
 * @param recordingMethod
 * @text Recording Method
 * @type select
 * @option MediaRecorder
 * @value mediarecorder
 * @option WebCodecs (NW.js 0.111+ only, performance friendly)
 * @value webcodecs
 * @default mediarecorder
 * @desc MediaRecorder works on all NW.js versions. WebCodecs requires NW.js 0.111+. Read more in plugin file.
 * 
 * @param videoBitrateMbps
 * @text Video Bitrate
 * @type number
 * @min 1
 * @default 20
 * @desc Target video bitrate in Mbps. Higher = Better quality but also larger file. For upload, 10-15. For editing, 100-300.
 * 
 * @param countdownSeconds
 * @text Countdown Before Record
 * @type number
 * @min 0
 * @max 10
 * @default 3
 * @desc Countdown before recording starts. 0 = instant.
 */

